  "title": "Pecan-Crusted Pork with Pumpkin Butter",
  "description": "Pork chops are crusted in pecans and breadcrumbs, then topped with a delicious homemade pumpkin butter. This is one of my favorite ways to eat pork.",
  "authors": [
    "Andrew Benoit"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:33:53-04:00",
